sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Buyer
  participant BFF as Consumer BFF
  participant CO as Checkout Orchestrator
  participant AE as Affordability Engine
  participant CD as Consent and Document
  participant RF as Risk and Fraud
  participant LA as Lender Adapter
  participant PO as Payment Orchestrator
  participant OB as Order Bridge
  participant EV as Event Bus

  Buyer->>BFF: Confirm selected plan
  BFF->>CO: POST /checkout-sessions/{id}/confirm
  CO->>AE: Revalidate immutable quote
  AE-->>CO: Quote valid until timestamp
  CO->>CD: Verify KFS version and consent proof
  CD-->>CO: Consent accepted
  CO->>RF: Final velocity and device check
  RF-->>CO: Allow
  CO->>LA: Reserve / book credit
  LA-->>CO: Lender reference confirmed
  CO->>PO: Collect amount due now or authorize UPI rail
  PO-->>CO: Payment confirmed
  CO->>OB: Place idempotent seller order
  OB-->>CO: Order accepted
  CO->>EV: CheckoutCompleted event
  CO-->>BFF: Order, credit and repayment references
  BFF-->>Buyer: Success and unified timeline

  Note over CO,OB: Every command has an idempotency key.<br/>Retries return the first result instead of charging twice.
